            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most businesses in New Zealand start seeing noticeable keyword ranking improvements and organic traffic gains within 60 to 90 days of White-Hat on-page and technical SEO implementation."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer Local SEO for specific cities in New Zealand?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes! We specialize in localized SEO targeting Auckland, Wellington, Christchurch & New Zealand with Google Map Pack 3-Pack optimization."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are your link building strategies 100% White-Hat Google compliant?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We strictly use 100% White-Hat, Google-compliant link building methods including editorial outreach, local citations in New Zealand, and high DA contextual backlinks."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Who manages my New Zealand SEO project?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Your campaign is executed by senior SEO leads and technical auditors supervised directly by Founder Gaurav Dubey."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why choose King of Digital Marketing for New Zealand SEO Services?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We bring 13+ years of experience delivering over 900+ successful rank campaigns across New Zealand, USA, UK, Europe, and Asia, backed by transparent pricing and high ROI."
          }
